      "headline": "Principal Customer Success Manager @Medtronic",
      "about": "I’m a delivery-focused leader with a strong track record of aligning teams and customers around clear goals and ensuring those goals get delivered, on time and with impact.\n\nWith experience in SaaS, healthcare, and cross-functional environments, I specialize in turning strategy into execution. I work closely with clients to understand what success looks like, then lead the teams, plans, and processes that bring that success to life.\n\nWhether I’m managing complex implementations, leading delivery teams, or building scalable customer workflows, I bring clarity, structure, and a strong sense of ownership to everything I do.\n\nKey strengths:\n- End-to-end delivery leadership across client lifecycles\n- Aligning internal teams and customer stakeholders\n- Building delivery frameworks that scale with growth\n- Driving adoption through clear communication and execution\n\nI adapt quickly to new industries and enjoy bringing fresh perspective to complex environments. Currently open to freelance or permanent opportunities where delivery excellence and customer alignment are key.",
